cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Fracture Detection: study-level musculoskeletal radiograph abnormality classification with calibration, uncertainty and Grad-CAM"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible PyTorch/Lightning pipeline for binary abnormality detection on
  upper-extremity radiographs (MURA), with patient-disjoint splitting, class-
  balanced focal loss, study-level probability aggregation, per-body-part Cohen's
  kappa against radiologist reference, temperature-scaling calibration, MC-dropout
  and selective-prediction uncertainty, Grad-CAM localisation, and a DICOM-capable
  FastAPI service.
